cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this audit or its harness, cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Four reversibility claims, re-measured: an independent audit of a reversible-computing suite"
abstract: >-
  An independent, plan-first audit of the four reversible-computing laboratories in the
  kostyk348/timelock-ca repository: bit-exact reversal of a Margolus block automaton, an
  Euler-characteristic lock, an HPP lattice gas claimed to show an emergent attraction, and a
  symplectic network trained with no stored activations. The package contains the experiment
  plan, the measurement harness, the raw logs, the number ledger and the paper source; every
  number in the paper is generated from the measurements.
authors:
